WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.640
Where would you go if you received a free one-month

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.640
train ticket anywhere in Europe?

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.640
Ludivine and her friends already know.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.320
Bulgaria, Denmark, Finland, Italy or Spain.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.880
The idea was launched by the European Parliament in 2016.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:28.040
What if we, the European Union, offered every 18-year-old European an Interrail ticket,

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.400
allowing them for three weeks to discover daily life across Europe?

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.160
This idea is now becoming a reality.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:42.120
This summer, 15,000 18-year-olds have the chance to receive a pass

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.360
to discover up to 30 countries in Europe.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.760
Initially, when the idea arose

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.680
to give away free Interrail tickets to young people

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.760
in order for them to discover the beauties of the continent,

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.000
many thought the idea was crazy and questioned its feasibility.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.440
Now we've taken this first step. But it's only the beginning, and we must take it further.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:05.920
To participate, the young candidates must be 18 on 1 July

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.360
and complete a form.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.960
Applications open in June, the journey starts this summer.

